{"id":"n23347-1-7","stage":4,"title":"안달 · 焦急","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23347-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 배고파요! 밥 빨리 주세요, 네?","zh":"妈妈，我饿了！请快点给我饭，好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"배고파요!","meaning":"肚子饿","explanation":"배고프다：肚子饿；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"배고프다","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29316","senseId":"1","lemma":"배고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배고파요","audio":"/audio/96d30539badafe900580.mp3"}},{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快。","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요,","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}},{"text":"네?","meaning":"好吗，行不行","explanation":"네：好吗，行不行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"4","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"8186b5026911737a","term":"배고프다","zh":"肚子饿","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3","entryId":"29316","definition":"感到肚子空了，想吃东西。","pronunciation":["배고프다"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"好吗，行不行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于纠缠或催促长辈。","pronunciation":["네"]}],"audio":"/audio/399d01d44eb7df931943.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23347-1-7-2","ko":"지금 하는 중이라니까 왜 그렇게 안달이니?","zh":"我都说了正在做呢，干嘛这么着急？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"중이라니까","meaning":"的时候","explanation":"중：的时候；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라니까：引用已经说过的话、命令等，作为后文的依据。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"2","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중이라니까","audio":"/audio/d650c62777b104867330.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"안달이니?","meaning":"焦急，焦心","explanation":"안달：焦急，焦心；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"안달","audio":"/audio/906c99464953638340d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23347","senseId":"1","lemma":"안달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안달이니","audio":"/audio/7c999287da799438f5cc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"的时候","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"在做某事的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"906c994649536383","term":"안달","zh":"焦急，焦心","audio":"/audio/906c99464953638340d8.mp3","entryId":"23347","definition":"着急且躁动。","pronunciation":["안달"]}],"audio":"/audio/d14d157438df9a658d70.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.845,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23347","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我都说了正在做呢，干嘛这么着急？","在老家也很难找到我们以前常去玩的那些地方了啊。","妈妈，我饿了！请快点给我饭，好吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我都说了正在做呢，干嘛这么着急？","妈妈，我饿了！请快点给我饭，好吗？","在老家也很难找到我们以前常去玩的那些地方了啊。"],"answer":0}]}
